{"seq":2,"slug":"online-evaluation","title":"在线评测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/online-evaluation","wordCount":1201,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"在线评测方法\">在线评测方法</h1><p>在线评测（Online Evaluation）通过观察真实用户行为来评估搜索系统的改进效果，弥补离线指标无法完全反映用户满意度的局限。A/B 测试和交织实验（Interleaving）是两类核心方法，各有适用场景。本篇系统讲解在线评测的实验设计、统计显著性分析和核心在线指标体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>A/B 测试（A/B Testing）将用户随机分为对照组（A：现有系统）和实验组（B：新系统），通过对比用户行为差异评估改进效果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Users[用户流量] --&gt; Split[流量分割\\n随机哈希分桶]&#10;    Split --&gt; A[A 组 50%\\n旧系统]&#10;    Split --&gt; B[B 组 50%\\n新系统]&#10;    A --&gt; LogA[行为日志]&#10;    B --&gt; LogB[行为日志]&#10;    LogA --&gt; Analysis[统计分析\\n假设检验]&#10;    LogB --&gt; Analysis&#10;    Analysis --&gt; Decision{显著改善?}\">graph LR\n    Users[用户流量] --&gt; Split[流量分割\\n随机哈希分桶]\n    Split --&gt; A[A 组 50%\\n旧系统]\n    Split --&gt; B[B 组 50%\\n新系统]\n    A --&gt; LogA[行为日志]\n    B --&gt; LogB[行为日志]\n    LogA --&gt; Analysis[统计分析\\n假设检验]\n    LogB --&gt; Analysis\n    Analysis --&gt; Decision{显著改善?}</pre><p><strong>实验设计关键决策</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策项</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分桶粒度</td>\n<td>用户级 vs 请求级</td>\n<td>优先用户级（避免同一用户体验混乱）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量比例</td>\n<td>1%/5%/50%</td>\n<td>从小流量开始（1-5%），验证无异常后扩量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验时长</td>\n<td>1天/7天/14天</td>\n<td>至少 7 天（覆盖周效应）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心指标</td>\n<td>主指标 + 护栏指标</td>\n<td>主指标优化，护栏指标不能显著下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>样本量计算</strong>：所需样本量由统计功效（power）、显著性水平（α）和最小可检测效果（MDE）共同决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{2(z_{\\alpha/2} + z_\\beta)^2 \\sigma^2}{\\Delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 MDE（最小可检测效果），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是指标方差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span>（功效 80%）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交织实验-更灵敏的排序比较\">交织实验：更灵敏的排序比较</h2><p><strong>Team-Draft Interleaving（TDI）</strong> 是专为搜索排序设计的对比实验方法，灵敏度比 A/B 测试高 5-10 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>核心原理</strong>：将两个排序系统（A 和 B）的结果交织为一个列表，在同一次搜索中同时展示，通过用户点击判断哪个系统更好。</p>\n<p><strong>Team-Draft Interleaving 算法</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"系统A排序: [a1, a2, a3, a4, a5]  (a1最相关)&#10;系统B排序: [b1, b2, b3, b4, b5]&#10;&#10;交织步骤：&#10;  1. 随机决定先从A或B选（假设先选A）&#10;  2. A选第一个未出现的文档: a1 → 交织列表 [a1]，A_team={a1}&#10;  3. B选第一个未出现的文档: b1 → 已出现? 否 → [a1, b1]，B_team={b1}&#10;  4. 继续交替: A选a2 → [a1, b1, a2]，A_team={a1, a2}&#10;  5. B选b2 → [a1, b1, a2, b2]，B_team={b1, b2}&#10;  ...&#10;&#10;最终交织: [a1, b1, a2, b2, a3, b3]&#10;用户看不到每个文档来自哪个系统\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>系统A排序: [a1, a2, a3, a4, a5]  (a1最相关)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>系统B排序: [b1, b2, b3, b4, b5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>交织步骤：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 随机决定先从A或B选（假设先选A）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. A选第一个未出现的文档: a1 → 交织列表 [a1]，A_team={a1}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. B选第一个未出现的文档: b1 → 已出现? 否 → [a1, b1]，B_team={b1}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 继续交替: A选a2 → [a1, b1, a2]，A_team={a1, a2}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. B选b2 → [a1, b1, a2, b2]，B_team={b1, b2}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最终交织: [a1, b1, a2, b2, a3, b3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>用户看不到每个文档来自哪个系统</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>结果判定</strong>：用户点击了哪些文档 → 统计 A_team 和 B_team 各自获得的点击数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>clicks(A_team) &gt; clicks(B_team) → A 胜</li>\n<li>clicks(B_team) &gt; clicks(A_team) → B 胜</li>\n<li>相等 → 平局</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TDI vs A/B 测试对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>A/B 测试</th>\n<th>TDI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灵敏度</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>高 5-10 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所需样本量</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>小（数千次查询）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验时长</td>\n<td>7-14 天</td>\n<td>1-3 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>任意系统变化</td>\n<td>排序列表对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏差</td>\n<td>新颖性偏差（用户偏向新内容）</td>\n<td>位置偏差已中和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理解难度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"在线指标体系\">在线指标体系</h2><p>在线实验依赖用户行为日志构建指标，核心指标分三类：</p>\n<p><strong>点击类指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CTR（点击通过率）</td>\n<td>点击次数 / 展示次数</td>\n<td>直接、高数量</td>\n<td>被标题/摘要吸引力污染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pCTR（Position-Corrected CTR）</td>\n<td>纠正位置偏差后的 CTR</td>\n<td>更公平</td>\n<td>需要位置偏差模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expected CTR</td>\n<td>E[CTR] 按位置期望</td>\n<td>可比较不同位置文档</td>\n<td>计算复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Session 类指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>信号强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Session Success Rate</td>\n<td>有效 session（点击后无立即返回）占比</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zero Result Rate</td>\n<td>无结果查询占比（应趋近 0）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reformulation Rate</td>\n<td>用户修改查询后再次搜索的比例</td>\n<td>高（高改写 = 未满足）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Time to Click</td>\n<td>用户点击第一个结果的平均时间</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Abandonment Rate</td>\n<td>无点击就离开的比例</td>\n<td>高（但噪声大）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>满意度类指标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Dwell Time（停留时长）分级：&#10;  &lt; 10s  → 快速跳出（不满意）&#10;  10-30s → 中等&#10;  30-120s → 满意&#10;  &gt; 120s → 深度阅读&#10;&#10;Long Click（长点击率）：停留 &gt; 30s 的点击占总点击比例&#10;Short Click（短点击率）：停留 &lt; 10s 的点击占总点击比例（负面信号）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Dwell Time（停留时长）分级：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C; 10s  → 快速跳出（不满意）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  10-30s → 中等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  30-120s → 满意</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  > 120s → 深度阅读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Long Click（长点击率）：停留 > 30s 的点击占总点击比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Short Click（短点击率）：停留 &#x3C; 10s 的点击占总点击比例（负面信号）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>护栏指标（Guardrail Metrics）</strong>：确保优化主指标时不损害核心体验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>护栏指标</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面加载时间（P99）</td>\n<td>不超过 +5%</td>\n<td>性能不能显著退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zero Result Rate</td>\n<td>不超过 baseline</td>\n<td>覆盖率不能下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要商业指标（DAU/收入）</td>\n<td>不显著下降</td>\n<td>防止搜索变化伤害核心业务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"统计显著性与多重检验问题\">统计显著性与多重检验问题</h2><p><strong>假设检验</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy import stats&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;# A/B 测试结果&#10;ctr_a = np.array([0.052, 0.048, 0.055, ...])  # A 组每日 CTR&#10;ctr_b = np.array([0.058, 0.062, 0.059, ...])  # B 组每日 CTR&#10;&#10;# 双样本 t 检验&#10;t_stat, p_value = stats.ttest_ind(ctr_a, ctr_b)&#10;&#10;if p_value &lt; 0.05:&#10;    print(f&quot;显著改善 (p={p_value:.4f})&quot;)&#10;    relative_lift = (ctr_b.mean() - ctr_a.mean()) / ctr_a.mean()&#10;    print(f&quot;相对提升: {relative_lift:.2%}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># A/B 测试结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctr_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.052</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.055</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># A 组每日 CTR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctr_b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.058</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.062</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.059</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># B 组每日 CTR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 双样本 t 检验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t_stat, p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.ttest_ind(ctr_a, ctr_b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"显著改善 (p=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relative_lift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ctr_b.mean() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctr_a.mean()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctr_a.mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"相对提升: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">relative_lift</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多重检验问题</strong>：同时检验多个指标时，误报率（False Positive）上升。若同时测 20 个指标，期望有 1 个显著（纯噪声）。</p>\n<p>解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bonferroni 校正</strong>：将显著性阈值调整为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为指标数）</li>\n<li><strong>FDR 控制</strong>（Benjamini-Hochberg）：控制假发现率而非每个指标的错误率</li>\n<li><strong>主指标 + 护栏设计</strong>：只对主指标做假设检验，护栏指标只看方向</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>A/B 测试</strong>是最可靠的在线评测方法，需要足够样本量（7+ 天，随机用户分桶）</li>\n<li><strong>交织实验</strong>比 A/B 测试灵敏 5-10 倍，所需样本更少，特别适合快速迭代排序改进</li>\n<li><strong>在线指标</strong>的质量由高到低：session success &gt; long click &gt; CTR（CTR 受位置偏差和标题吸引力污染）</li>\n<li><strong>护栏指标</strong>防止优化主指标时损害性能/覆盖率/商业指标</li>\n<li><strong>多重检验</strong>是 A/B 测试的常见陷阱，同时检验多个指标需要 Bonferroni 校正或 FDR 控制</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：在线评测的改进目标需要离线指标（本章第 1 篇）预先验证；相关性标注（本章第 3 篇）提供离线 ground truth，与在线指标形成双重验证。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"在线评测方法","id":"在线评测方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"交织实验：更灵敏的排序比较","id":"交织实验-更灵敏的排序比较"},{"level":2,"text":"在线指标体系","id":"在线指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"统计显著性与多重检验问题","id":"统计显著性与多重检验问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"离线评测指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/offline-evaluation-metrics"},"next":{"title":"相关性标注体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/relevance-judgment"}}